      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Now make it live. Put an Inert T1 Warhead and 1 to 8 Plastic Explosive in a crafting grid and you get a live T1 warhead with that many charges, up to its cap of 5. A bare casing with charges alone is a Condensed warhead, plain high explosive. A casing with a payload becomes that blast type.\n\nPut the warhead back in the grid with more Plastic Explosive to top it up; a load that would pass the cap simply doesn\u0027t craft, so nothing is wasted. For automation, the Assembler fills a whole casing at once: an inert warhead and 5 Plastic Explosive on the blast\u0027s circuit. Check NEI.\n\nThe tooltip shows the charges, the blast radius and the center damage. Make one warhead, any type, any fill.\n\n[warn]A warhead is a live explosive block. Fire, redstone and nearby explosions all set it off.[/warn]",
